From f05cb5157f8730eb28d2b3ea4d39b0faf306d76f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Super User <root@localhost.localdomain>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 04:43:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] KVM: arm64: Archive HDBSS code to dirty_bit.c and add
 internal API

Move all HDBSS-related implementation to arch/arm64/kvm/dirty_bit.c
and arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_dirty_bit.h. Rename __load_hdbss to
kvm_load_hdbss and provide kvm_handle_hdbss_fault_if_present() as
the external fault handler.

Add new internal API:
- kvm_arm_enable_hdbss_internal(kvm, order)
- kvm_arm_disable_hdbss_internal(kvm)
- hdbss_auto_select_order(kvm)

These replace the ioctl-based interface and will be wired to
migration hooks in a subsequent patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
